{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "tract_developer_geometry_window_styles",
  "spec": ["tract-developer 4.10.1", "tract-developer 4.10.3", "tract-developer 4.12", "tract-developer 4.16", "tract-developer 11.10", "tract-developer 11.11", "tract-developer 11.12", "tract-developer 11.13", "tract-developer 11.15"],
  "description": "Tests 10-13 and 15, by hand from 4.10.1, 4.10.3, 4.12, 4.16. Test 10: anchor (10, 20), size (3, 2): facing 0 x 8..10 z 20..21; 1 x 9..10 z 18..20; 2 x 10..12 z 19..20; 3 x 10..11 z 20..22; facing 5 is taken modulo 4 [choice] (= 1). Test 11: facing 1, required bit 0 -> side j = (1 + 0 + 1) mod 4 = 2: only rail there -> false; one street tile -> true; roads_check gives [27, corner true] (hasReq). Bits {3} only: hasReq false (bit 3 ignored, quirk); requireRoads true -> 21; requireRoads false -> TestForCornerLot on side (1 + 3 + 1) mod 4 = 1: a road there -> [27, false], none -> 21. Test 12: type 2, existing 12, desiredMax 30, built 5 -> lo 13, hi max(37, 14) = 37; type 4, n 3 -> lo 13 / 3 = 4, hi max(37, 5) = 37; existing 0, desiredMax 0, built 5 -> lo 1, hi max(-5, 2) = 2; existing 2^31-1: lo + 1 overflows, lo stays 2147483647, hi = max(2147483647, wrapped -2^31) = 2147483647. Test 13: p = rhe(r24(pct x 100)): 0.3 -> 30, 0.7 -> 70, 0.125 -> rhe(12.5) = 12, 0.005 -> rhe(0.5) = 0; map {0x2000: 0.3, 0x2001: 0.7}: r 4 -> 0x2000, 30 -> 0x2001, 99 -> 0x2001, 100 -> no group (0); keys walked ascending even when given out of order; {0x2000: 0.125}: r 12 -> 0, r 11 -> 0x2000. Test 15: identity-hash 193-bucket set, chain front insertion: 5 then 198 (both bucket 5) iterate 198, 5; 0x100, 0x101, 0x102, 0x2C1, 0x3 iterate 0x3 (bucket 3), 0x100 (63), 0x101 (64), 0x102 (65), 0x2C1 (126); a repeated value is not inserted again. Set growth and the sort are in td00_hash_growth_sort.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "rect", "args": [10, 20, 3, 2, 0], "expect": [8, 20, 10, 21]},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "rect", "args": [10, 20, 3, 2, 1], "expect": [9, 18, 10, 20]},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "rect", "args": [10, 20, 3, 2, 2], "expect": [10, 19, 12, 20]},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "rect", "args": [10, 20, 3, 2, 3], "expect": [10, 20, 11, 22]},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "rect", "args": [10, 20, 3, 2, 5], "expect": [9, 18, 10, 20]},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "corner", "args": [[true], {"facing": 1, "rail": [0,0,1,0]}], "expect": false},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "corner", "args": [[true], {"facing": 1, "street": [0,0,1,0]}], "expect": true},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "corner", "args": [[true], {"facing": 1, "street": [1,1,0,1]}], "expect": false},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "roads_check", "args": [[true], {"facing": 1, "street": [0,0,1,0]}, true], "expect": [27, true]},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "roads_check", "args": [[true], {"facing": 1, "rail": [0,0,1,0]}, false], "expect": 21},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "roads_check", "args": [[false, false, false, true], {"facing": 1, "road": [0,1,0,0]}, true], "expect": 21},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "roads_check", "args": [[false, false, false, true], {"facing": 1, "road": [0,1,0,0]}, false], "expect": [27, false]},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "roads_check", "args": [[false, false, false, true], {"facing": 1, "road": [1,0,1,1]}, false], "expect": 21},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "roads_check", "args": [[], {"facing": 0}, false], "expect": [27, false]},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "capacity_window", "args": [{"kind": 2, "existing": 12}, 30, 5], "expect": [13, 37]},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "capacity_window", "args": [{"kind": 4, "existing": 12, "n": 3}, 30, 5], "expect": [4, 37]},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "capacity_window", "args": [{"kind": 2, "existing": 0}, 0, 5], "expect": [1, 2]},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "capacity_window", "args": [{"kind": 2, "existing": 2147483647}, 0, 0], "expect": [2147483647, 2147483647]},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "style_points", "args": [0.3], "expect": 30},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "style_points", "args": [0.7], "expect": 70},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "style_points", "args": [0.125], "expect": 12},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "style_points", "args": [0.005], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "style_group", "args": [[["0x2000", 0.3], ["0x2001", 0.7]], 4], "expect": "0x2000"},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "style_group", "args": [[["0x2000", 0.3], ["0x2001", 0.7]], 30], "expect": "0x2001"},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "style_group", "args": [[["0x2000", 0.3], ["0x2001", 0.7]], 99], "expect": "0x2001"},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "style_group", "args": [[["0x2000", 0.3], ["0x2001", 0.7]], 100], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "style_group", "args": [[["0x2001", 0.7], ["0x2000", 0.3]], 4], "expect": "0x2000"},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "style_group", "args": [[["0x2000", 0.125]], 12], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "tdev_eval", "fn": "style_group", "args": [[["0x2000", 0.125]], 11], "expect": "0x2000"},
